[C1] PASS amplification factors on u' = lambda u: rk1 1+z; rk2 to z^2/2; rk3 to z^3/6; rk3s4 to z^3/6 + z^4/48; max error 2.2e-16
[C2] PASS fitted order on a nonlinear ODE, n = 40, 80, 160 steps: rk1 1.01, rk2 2.01, rk3 3.02, rk3s4 3.01
[C3] PASS each stage is a convex combination of u0 and a forward-Euler step; SSP coefficient C = min over stages of (Euler weight)/w2: rk1 C=1, rk2 C=1, rk3 C=1, rk3s4 C=2
[C4] PASS the stage values stay nonnegative up to dt = C: rk3 nonnegative for dt <= 1; rk3s4 nonnegative for dt <= 2
